        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AC-S7, South Beach Lever With Contemporary Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Fusion, the South Beach Lever is a simple lever with a modern design. It is paired with the Square Rose that transforms this leverset into something truly contemporary. The square shape allows for the South Beach Lever With Square Rose to look great in all contemporary decors. It is available in brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and polished chrome finishes. Easy to install, the South Beach Leverset will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AC-S7 Solid Brass Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for South Beach Door Lever With Square Rose Fusion AC-S7:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose: 2-1/2\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary South Beach Lever With Square Rose, Fusion AC-S7",
                "description": "Fusion AC-S7, South Beach Lever With Contemporary Square Rose - Made by Fusion, the South Beach Lever is a simple lever with a modern design. It is paired with the Square Rose that transforms this leverset into something truly contemporary. The square shape allows for the South Beach Lever With Square Rose to look great in all contemporary decors. It is available in brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and polished chrome finishes. Easy to install, the South Beach Leverset will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n",
